## AI Assistance Disclosure

FungiCapture was built with use of AI coding assistants (large
language models. AI tools helped write a large part of the source code, the tests, and this
documentation.

**Human oversight.** The authors directed the design, guided
the AI, and reviewed the output. The authors take responsibility for the project
as a whole. However, this review is **ongoing** — not every line of
code or every sentence of the docs has been fully checked or tested yet.

**Please validate before use.** This is a research tool. The
results it produces are **not guaranteed to be correct**. Before you use
any output in your own analysis, thesis, or publication, please test the
tool against data you already understand (a known ground truth) and
confirm the numbers make sense for your case. Treat FungiCapture as a
helper, not as a source of final, verified truth.

**Extra care for measured values used in statistics.** FungiCapture
produces statistics that you may feed into a downstream analysis such as a GWAS. A small, silent
error in these numbers can create a false gene–trait association or hide
a real one, and this kind of mistake is hard to notice later. Before you
use these values, manually check a random sample of them against the
original images and confirm they match. Do this again whenever you
change your input images, settings, or the tool version.

